{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415711","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415711","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041571101:0":{"text":"我在萨洛克兰见过许多一直戴着面具的人，这是某种必要的社交礼仪吗？","source_cn":"我在萨洛克兰见过许多一直戴着面具的人，这是某种必要的社...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F51024FCED56F8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041571102:0":{"text":"哦，尊贵的半神大人竟然会对繁琐的人类事务感兴趣，这可真是有点吓到我了。","source_cn":"哦，尊贵的半神大人竟然会对繁琐的人类事务感兴趣，这可真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DB0CAF4BCA99A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041571103:1":{"text":"那只能说明你不了解我。我喜欢研究凡人的生活方式。","source_cn":"那只能说明你不了解我。我喜欢研究凡人的生活方式。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8E138B0581ACB51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041571104:1":{"text":"你们的美食、节日，还有音乐！哈，每一样都很有趣！","source_cn":"你们的美食、节日，还有音乐！哈，每一样都很有趣！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B18539B0C613A1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041571105:1":{"text":"啊，我明白了。我一定端正态度，为您答疑解惑。","source_cn":"啊，我明白了。我一定端正态度，为您答疑解惑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85D3B07F3E8982B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041571106:1":{"text":"至于您刚才那个问题的答案——是的，在萨洛克兰的社交礼仪中，面具的确很重要。","source_cn":"至于您刚才那个问题的答案——是的，在萨洛克兰的社交礼仪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A89250026EF64B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041571107:1":{"text":"有多重要？","source_cn":"有多重要？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12FDA712F064C6F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041571108:1":{"text":"该怎么为您形容呢……","source_cn":"该怎么为您形容呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64C465D550C56042","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041571109:1":{"text":"贵族在重要的社交场合摘下面具，简直就像赤身裸体一样。这非常不礼貌。","source_cn":"贵族在重要的社交场合摘下面具，简直就像赤身裸体一样。这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1EBF06B86FEDF96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041571110:1":{"text":"啊，半神大人，您应该理解“赤身裸体”这个词的意思。","source_cn":"啊，半神大人，您应该理解“赤身裸体”这个词的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9783692210E05788","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041571111:1":{"text":"当然，我掌握这个词很久了。","source_cn":"当然，我掌握这个词很久了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x212EFE92F253BEAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041571112:1":{"text":"不过为什么萨洛克兰的平民里基本没有戴面具的人？呃，好像也不是所有贵族都会戴面具？","source_cn":"不过为什么萨洛克兰的平民里基本没有戴面具的人？呃，好像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2AF802A1406F826","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041571113:1":{"text":"哈哈……当然是因为只有面见重要之人，才称得上是社交场合啊。比如觐见我母亲，或者见您。","source_cn":"哈哈……当然是因为只有面见重要之人，才称得上是社交场合...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18C1EB09928D9BD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041571114:1":{"text":"……好吧，我想我理解了一些。","source_cn":"……好吧，我想我理解了一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC443840409F846F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041571115:1":{"text":"总而言之，我最好有一张面具，戴上它能体现我对萨洛克兰人的尊重，对吗？","source_cn":"总而言之，我最好有一张面具，戴上它能体现我对萨洛克兰人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6C0CBEC52CFAAB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041571116:1":{"text":"没错。","source_cn":"没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AD9047FF5D80BF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":